cards.rules:
Once each turn, when a permanent you control enters from exile, untap it and put a +1/+1 counter on it if it's a creature.
//Adventure// Find the Castaway — {1}{U} — Sorcery — Adventure
Manifest fate.

This creature enters prepared. Whenever you cast your first spell from exile each turn, Theoclymenus, Omen Reader becomes prepared.
//Prep// Quiet Warning — {1}{U} — Instant — Prep
Tap target creature. It doesn't untap during its controller's next untap step.

{T}: Target Vehicle you control gets +1/+0 and gains haste until end of turn.
//Adventure// Bottle the Winds — {1}{U} — Instant — Adventure
Untap target Vehicle you control. It gains flying until end of turn. Draw a card.

This creature enters prepared. Whenever one or more face-down creatures you control attack, this creature becomes prepared. This ability triggers only once each turn.
//Prep// Circe's Draught — {1}{U}{B} — Sorcery
Turn target nontoken creature face down.

Flying.
//Adventure// Saving Veil — {1}{U} — Instant — Adventure
Return target tapped creature you control to its owner's hand. Draw a card.
